<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez sets property stocks basket warrants.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez sets property stocks basket warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said Thursday it has issued 75 million American-style call warrants on a basket of four property developer stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p>  HKR International Ltd		  1 shares</p>
<p>  Tai Cheung Holdings Ltd		1 shares</p>
<p>  Hon Kwok Land Investment Co Ltd  0.5 shares</p>
<p>  Lai Sun Development Co Ltd	   1 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$23.7044   PREMIUM	 9.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.6938    GEARING	 4.02x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.OCT.97    PAYDATE	 UNAVAILIABLE</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  40,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$27.8875</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
